 alignment design, in beautiful shades of yellow, blue, green, lilac, and white on our super-grippy mat surface. Inspired by the celestial energy of the lunar cycle, this visually stunning Yoga mat is designed to support your physical and spiritual transformation.\\nPrinted using durable, eco-friendly, non-toxic inks, our Planet-friendly Yoga mat is made with sustainably sourced natural rubber and PVC-free materials. The unmatched non-slip surface allowing you to hold poses longer and avoid slipping, even in the sweatiest of Yoga practices.\\nDesigned to be longer and wider than standard Yoga mats, it gives you more space to move freely, with the perfect balance of firm stability and soft cushioning for every pose - ideal for all body types and Yoga styles.\\nIncludes a complimentary Yoga Mat bag for easy carrying and storage.\u00a0\",\"variant_title\":\"Dusk Blue\",\"variant_options\":[\"Dusk Blue\"],\"options_with_values\":[{\"name\":\"Colour\",\"value\":\"Dusk Blue\"}],\"line_level_discount_allocations\":[],\"line_level_total_discount\":0,\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1},\"has_components\":false,\"tags\":[\"4.2mm cushioning\",\"4mm\",\"AlignForMe\",\"alignment guides\",\"all-level yoga\",\"beginner yoga\",\"BOGO50\",\"buy_x\",\"colour-black\",\"colour-blue\",\"colour-dusk-blue\",\"cosmic-collection\",\"eco-friendly-ink\",\"get_y\",\"GripForMe\",\"home yoga\",\"hot yoga\",\"multi-buy-upsell\",\"natural rubber\",\"NEW-SITE\",\"posture support\",\"premium yoga mat\",\"PVC-free\",\"regular size\",\"sale\",\"standard size\",\"Star Pick AUS\",\"Star Pick Canada\",\"Star pick EU\",\"Star Pick SEA\",\"Star Pick UK\",\"Star Pick US\",\"sustainable yoga mat\",\"type-Yoga Mat\",\"update-feed\",\"vegan\",\"vinyasa yoga\",\"YGroup_cosmic-yogamat\"],\"collections\":[\"yoga-mats\",\"shop-all\",\"regular\",\"not-giftcard\",\"best-yoga-mats\",\"yoga-mat\",\"shop-liforme\",\"not-giftcard-not-customiser-not-bundles\",\"not-giftcard-not-customiser\",\"not-g